   "BFCL v5 NOT released as of 2026-06-23; v4 remains current (changelog last entry 2025-10-01; v4 announced 2025-07-17). Top-of-leaderboard for BFCL v4 (June 2026) is Qwen3.7 Max @ 75.0% per llm-stats aggregator; Anthropic/OpenAI/Google flagships not yet listed on official BFCL v4 leaderboard.",
   "MCP-Atlas refresh April 8 2026: Scale Labs updated scoring judge, added retry handling, replaced 20-turn limit with 100-tool-call budget; re-scored all models against 1000 tasks (500 public + 500 private).",
   "tau3-Bench Banking is now the canonical Sierra/AA tau-family agent eval; replaces tau2-Bench Telecom in AAII v4.1 (June 16 2026). 'Even frontier models with high reasoning budgets reach only ~25.5% pass@1' per AA.",
   "Toolathlon (ICLR 2026) is the formal academic name for Tool-Decathlon (32 apps, 604 tools, 108 tasks, ~20 turns/task).",
   "Three NEW arxiv tool-use benchmarks published 2026: FinMCP-Bench (arxiv 2603.24943, 65 financial MCPs), FinToolBench (arxiv 2603.08262, 760 financial tools), FinTrace (arxiv 2604.10015, 800 trajectories)."
  ],
